    honestNote:
      'His own lines are quoted only where the recording reads cleanly; the rest is given as summary. The performances he describes are named from the public record of the 2014 ceremony and from the performer’s own description of her song. His claims that named performers made covenants with the adversary, that their careers and deaths were arranged, and his remarks about particular celebrities are not repeated: the record holds no evidence for them, and the Word tells us to pray for such people, which he himself urged in another sermon. His teaching about portals, the Nephilim and transhumanism goes beyond what Scripture says; Genesis 6:4 names the giants and stops, and the lesson stays with the text. He attributed the words "your idols are demons" to Jesus; the teaching is Paul’s, in 1 Corinthians 10:20, and the lesson cites it there.',
