      'Pastor Darby teaches that the new world order, rightly understood, is not first a matter of parties or nations but of the adversary’s age-old bid to rule the world’s systems through people who take his offer. The war is spiritual, against principalities, not flesh and blood. The one force that can frustrate it is a praying church, so the adversary’s strategy is to keep believers distracted, entertained and looking to politics instead of to the King. His call is to pray, fast, deny the flesh and put something on the altar, so that the smoke of the saints’ prayers rises again.',
